    "detailed_description": "FLAKE<br />\r\nCOLDEST POINT AND CLICK ADVENTURE EVER<br />\r\n<br />\r\nEmbark on this MYSTICAL journey in the role of FLAKE, an incredible creature.<br />\r\nWill you be able walk the THIN WHITE LINE BETWEEN GOOD AND EVIL?<br />\r\nWhat will you do with your chance to save the world that is hanging on a thread?<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPrepare your PIPE and finest tobacco or a warm cup of TEA and get ready for long sleepless nights...<br />\r\njust like back in GOLDEN AGE of point and clicks with Lucas art adventures like Monkey island, Full throttle or Indiana Jones...<br />\r\nonly this time FROZEN COLD.<br />\r\nStory driven adventure, hand drawn characters, smart puzzles, and witty humor, wrapped in unique graphical style.<br />\r\nYEARS in the making.<br />\r\nFully HAND-DRAWN and with classical FRAME-BY-FRAME animation.<br />\r\nMore then 20 Fully VOICED characters and original SOUNDTRACK.",
